<title>FINLAND: ASPO SAYS MAY HAVE TO PAY LESS EXTRA TAX.</title>
<headline>ASPO SAYS MAY HAVE TO PAY LESS EXTRA TAX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish electronics and chemicals group and steel wholesaler Aspoyhtyma Oy said on Friday that a new tax ruling meant the potential extra tax it may have to pay would be only some 10 million markka instead of 60-80 million estimated earlier.</p>
</text>
